<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BOLIDEN STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BOLIDEN STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Thursday it started coverage of Boliden Ltd, a Swedish mining company which has redomiciled to Toronto, with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Wayne Atwell said his 12-month price target was C$9.80 per share and he believed the stock had attractive upside because of its initial pulic offering was structured as an installment receipt.</p>
<p>-- Atwell said Boliden, which mines zinc, has a very good management team and growth prospects as well as aggressive plans to become an international mining company.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Plus, zinc prices have risen about 61 percent since November,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
